### Esportra .NET API — Phase 1 Smoke Test Plan
### Run sequentially. Replace all {{...}} variables with real values before running.
###
### Prerequisites:
###   1. dotnet run --project src/Esportra.Api  (port 5200)
###   2. Redis running on localhost:6379
###   3. Fill in variables below

@base        = http://localhost:5200
@jwt         = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...  # Supabase session JWT
@adminJwt    = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...  # Admin user JWT (has admin role)
@testEmail   = test@example.com
@testUserId  = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001       # real user UUID in DB
@matchId     = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002       # real brkt_match UUID
@versionId   = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003       # real brkt_version UUID
@sponsorId   = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004       # real sponsor profile UUID
@reportId    = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005       # real match_result_reports UUID

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. HEALTH
# Expected: 200 { status: "healthy", timestamp, version }
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/health

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. JWT PROBE  (GET /api/me)
# Expected: 200 { userId, email, roles[], permissions[] }
# Fail case: 401 if JWT is expired/wrong secret
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. AUTH — Send Recovery Email  (POST /api/auth/recovery)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Recovery email sent." }
# DB side: Supabase generates token_hash, Resend delivers the email
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/auth/recovery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. AUTH — Set Password via Token Hash  (POST /api/auth/set-password)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Password updated." }
# Precondition: use the token_hash returned from step 3's Supabase link
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/auth/set-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tokenHash": "PASTE_TOKEN_HASH_HERE",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword123!"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. AUTH — Set Password via Session (authenticated)  (POST /api/auth/set-password)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Password updated." }
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/auth/set-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "newPassword": "AnotherSecure456!"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. ADMIN — Delete User  (POST /api/admin/users/{userId}/action)
# Expected: 200 { message: "User deleted." }
# Requires: users:delete permission (ops_admin or tournament_admin role)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/admin/users/{{testUserId}}/action
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}

{
  "action": "delete-user"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 7. ADMIN — Update Role  (POST /api/admin/users/{userId}/action)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Role updated." }
# Requires: users:edit permission
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/admin/users/{{testUserId}}/action
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}

{
  "action": "update-role",
  "role": "venue_admin"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 8. ADMIN — Invite Sponsor  (POST /api/sponsors/invite)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Sponsor invited.", userId, setupLink }
# Creates Supabase user + profile row + sends PartnerInvite email
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/sponsors/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}

{
  "sponsorEmail": "sponsor@brand.com",
  "sponsorName": "Acme Corp",
  "sponsorId": "{{sponsorId}}"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 9. ADMIN — Send Email  (POST /api/emails)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Email sent." }
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/emails
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}

{
  "to": "{{testEmail}}",
  "type": "Welcome",
  "data": {
    "username": "TestUser"
  }
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 10. INTEGRATIONS — Riot API Proxy  (POST /api/integrations/riot/proxy)
# Expected: 200 — proxied Riot API JSON response
# Tests allowlist: /riot/account/v1/accounts/by-riot-id/ is allowed
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/integrations/riot/proxy
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "region": "americas",
  "endpoint": "/riot/account/v1/accounts/by-riot-id/TestPlayer/EUW"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 11. INTEGRATIONS — Faceit API Proxy  (POST /api/integrations/faceit/proxy)
# Expected: 200 — proxied Faceit API JSON response
# Tests allowlist: /players is allowed
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/integrations/faceit/proxy
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "endpoint": "/players?nickname=s1mple"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 12. INTEGRATIONS — Riot Unlink  (DELETE /api/integrations/riot)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Riot account unlinked." }
# Deletes row from riot_accounts for the calling user
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{base}}/api/integrations/riot
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 13. INTEGRATIONS — Faceit Unlink  (DELETE /api/integrations/faceit)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Faceit account unlinked." }
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{base}}/api/integrations/faceit
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 14. GAMES — Search  (GET /api/games/search?q=)
# Expected: 200 — RAWG results (first call hits RAWG, subsequent calls hit DB cache)
# Check: make 2 calls — second should be slightly faster (cache hit)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/api/games/search?q=valorant
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 15. GAMES — Screenshots  (GET /api/games/{id}/screenshots)
# Expected: 200 — RAWG screenshots array
# Replace 58877 with a real RAWG game ID (Valorant = 58877)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/api/games/58877/screenshots
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 16. METRICS — Record Metric  (POST /api/metrics)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Metric recorded." }
# Check sponsor_metrics table in Supabase for a new row with geoip + visitor_id
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sponsorId": "{{sponsorId}}",
  "eventType": "impression",
  "pageUrl": "https://esportra.com/tournaments/test-slug"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 17. MATCHES — Finalize Match  (POST /api/matches/{matchId}/finalize)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Match finalized." }  or 409 if already locked
# Calls finalize_match_locked RPC on Supabase
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/finalize
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 18. MATCHES — Scan Recent Matches (STUB)  (POST /api/matches/scan)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Scan stub — Phase 2." }
# This is a stub until Phase 2 (Riot API PUUID verification)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/matches/scan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "matchId": "{{matchId}}",
  "mapName": "Haven",
  "gameNumber": 1
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 19. MATCHES — Process Match Result (STUB)  (POST /api/matches/{matchId}/process)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Process stub — Phase 2." }
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/process
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "reportId": "{{reportId}}"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 20. BRACKETS — Advance  (POST /api/brackets/advance)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Bracket advanced." }
# Requires: valid eventId in bracket_events table + matchId in brkt_matches
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/brackets/advance
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}

{
  "matchId": "{{matchId}}",
  "eventId": "PASTE_EVENT_ID_HERE"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 21. BRACKETS — Get Cached UI State  (GET /api/brackets/{versionId})
# Expected: 200 — cached bracket JSON blob
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base}}/api/brackets/{{versionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 22. BRACKETS — Rebuild Cache  (POST /api/brackets/{versionId}/cache)
# Expected: 200 { message: "Cache rebuilt." }
# Check: brkt_versions.cached_ui_state updated in Supabase
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{base}}/api/brackets/{{versionId}}/cache
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ALLOWLIST BLOCK TESTS (should return 400)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Blocked Riot endpoint (not in allowlist)
POST {{base}}/api/integrations/riot/proxy
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "region": "americas",
  "endpoint": "/lol/summoner/v4/summoners/me"
}

###

# Blocked Faceit endpoint (not in allowlist)
POST {{base}}/api/integrations/faceit/proxy
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "endpoint": "/hubs/123/members"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTHZ BLOCK TESTS (should return 403)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Non-admin trying to delete a user
POST {{base}}/api/admin/users/{{testUserId}}/action
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

{
  "action": "delete-user"
}

###

# Unauthenticated request to /api/me
GET {{base}}/api/me

###
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# STEP-BY-STEP TEST PROCEDURE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# 1. SETUP
#    a. Start API:   dotnet run --project src/Esportra.Api
#    b. Start Redis: docker run -p 6379:6379 redis:7-alpine  (or docker compose up redis)
#    c. Fill variables at top of this file:
#       - @jwt      → paste a valid Supabase JWT from your browser DevTools (Network tab)
#       - @adminJwt → log in as an admin user in the app, grab that JWT
#       - @testUserId / @matchId / @versionId / @sponsorId / @reportId → real UUIDs from DB
#
# 2. RUN IN ORDER
#    Test 1  → expect 200 healthy
#    Test 2  → expect 200 with your userId + roles list
#    Tests 3-5  → check Resend dashboard for delivered email
#    Tests 6-9  → need adminJwt; check Supabase Auth + profiles table for changes
#    Tests 10-13 → check Riot/Faceit API responses + riot_accounts/faceit_accounts table
#    Tests 14-15 → first call slow (RAWG hit), second call fast (DB cache in games_metadata)
#    Test 16     → check sponsor_metrics table for new row with country + visitor_id
#    Tests 17-19 → need real match UUIDs; verify brkt_matches state in Supabase
#    Tests 20-22 → need real bracket UUIDs; verify brkt_versions.cached_ui_state
#
# 3. BLOCK TESTS (last section)
#    Allowlist blocks → expect 400 "Endpoint not allowed"
#    Authz blocks    → expect 401 or 403
#
# 4. PASS CRITERIA
#    All numbered tests return 2xx
#    All block tests return 4xx
#    No 500 errors anywhere
#    Resend emails delivered (check dashboard)
#    DB tables updated as noted above
#
